# Fast city test with a RECORDED route (play.ps1 -RecordRoute <name> -> work\routes\<name>.pad): boot the
# first save, placeholder movies, wait for the HUD (no presses) = anchor, then the game replays the route
# time-indexed from the anchor (PS3_PAD_REPLAY; the exe needs the toolkit's pad route hook, agent/testspeed).
# Another route: -Extra "PS3_PAD_REPLAY=S:\...\work\routes\<name>.pad". Windows: set them for the route.
#! seconds 260
#! anchor_range 55:100
#! savefrom work\saves\first-save\gamedata
#! replay work\routes\city1.pad
#! windows 2:16,20:46,48:55
wait v_02_city_intro 120
sleep 2
waitimg city_hud 40,20,340,130 15 120
sleep 2
anchor
at 8
shot a8
at 20
shot a20
at 32
shot a32
at 44
shot a44
at 54
shot a54
at 56
close
